    id: "2e1cb8ed-59cb-45f2-81f3-740533e7be51",
    slug: "doctor",
    name: "Doctor",
    description: "There are earlier Doctor recipes combining Swedish punch and rum (see Doctor No. 1), but this recipe, which first appeared in Frank Meier's 1936 Artistry of Mixing Drinks , has proved the most enduring, helped by its being republished in Victor Bergeron 's 1947 Bartender's Guide... by Trader Vic DOCTOR In shaker: a teaspoon each of Lemon and Orange juice, half Swedish Punch, half Bacardi; shake well and serve. Frank Meier, Artistry of Mixing Drinks, 1936 DOCTOR COCKTAIL 1\u00bd oz. Swedish Punch \u00be oz. Jamaica rum 1 tsp. lemon juice 1 tsp. orange juice Shake well with cracked ice; strain into chilled cocktail glass. Variations: Substitute the juice of \u00bd lime for lemon and orange juice. Equal parts rum and Swedish punch may be used. Victor Bergeron, Bartender's Guide By Trader Vic, 1947",
    image_url: "https://cdn.diffordsguide.com/cocktail/nOzbEO/square/0/512x512.webp?v=1737701574",
    origin: "",
    base: [],
    modifiers: [],
    glass: "Coupe",
    garnish: "",
    tags: ["intermediate"],
    story: "There are earlier Doctor recipes combining Swedish punch and rum (see Doctor No. 1), but this recipe, which first appeared in Frank Meier's 1936 Artistry of Mixing Drinks , has proved the most enduring, helped by its being republished in Victor Bergeron 's 1947 Bartender's Guide... by Trader Vic DOCTOR In shaker: a teaspoon each of Lemon and Orange juice, half Swedish Punch, half Bacardi; shake well and serve. Frank Meier, Artistry of Mixing Drinks, 1936 DOCTOR COCKTAIL 1\u00bd oz. Swedish Punch \u00be oz. Jamaica rum 1 tsp. lemon juice 1 tsp. orange juice Shake well with cracked ice; strain into chilled cocktail glass. Variations: Substitute the juice of \u00bd lime for lemon and orange juice. Equal parts rum and Swedish punch may be used. Victor Bergeron, Bartender's Guide By Trader Vic, 1947",
    recipe: ["45 ml Light white rum", "40 ml Swedish Punsch", "5 ml Lemon juice", "5 ml Orange juice", "4 drop Daiquiri bitters", "2 drop Saline solution 4:1"],
