    instructions: ["Select and pre-chill a COUPE GLASS.", "Prepare garnish of orange zest twist.", "STIR all ingredients with ice.", "FINE STRAIN into chilled glass.", "EXPRESS orange zest twist over the cocktail and use as garnish."],
